  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nIn dragenter and dragover events, drop effect is set based on effect allowed [HTML Standard (whatwg.org)](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dropEffect-initialisation), the spec says “if appropriate” in many cases and says it is based on platform conventions. What should the browser behavior be in such cases?",
